# i18n

- Default **`en`**, optional **`vi`**.
- Cookies: `eve_guest_locale` (`/chat`, `/b/[slug]`) vs `eve_dashboard_locale` (dashboard) — never cross-write.
- Agent default via `x-eve-locale`; still follow guest message language if different.
- Chrome copy → `messages/en.json` + `messages/vi.json`.
- DB FAQ / profile text is not auto-translated.
